  "name": "心识蕴藏之种",
  "content": "<color=#FFFFFFFF>战斗行动</color>：我方出战角色为<color=#FFFFFFFF>纳西妲</color>时，装备此牌。\\n纳西妲装备此牌后，立刻使用一次<color=#FFD780FF>心景幻成</color>。\\n装备有此牌的纳西妲在场时，根据我方队伍中存在的元素类型提供效果：\\n<img src='https://act-webstatic.mihoyo.com/hk4e/e20200928calculate/item_icon/67c7f719/54e95d5fad102409daf191d692c92adc.png' /><color=#FF9999FF>火元素</color>：<color=#FFFFFFFF>摩耶之殿</color>在场时，自身受到元素反应触发<color=#FFFFFFFF>蕴种印</color>的敌方角色，所受<color=#FFFFFFFF>蕴种印</color>的<color=#FFFFFFFF>穿透伤害</color>改为<img src='https://act-webstatic.mihoyo.com/hk4e/e20200928calculate/item_icon/67c7f719/0bfb3be161357095eefb85b88c1267a8.png' /><color=#7EC236FF>草元素伤害</color>；\\n<img src='https://act-webstatic.mihoyo.com/hk4e/e20200928calculate/item_icon/67c7f719/0ff87d31d2858dc563d4a441cdd42f95.png' /><color=#FFACFFFF>雷元素</color>：<color=#FFFFFFFF>摩耶之殿</color>入场时，使当前对方场上<color=#FFFFFFFF>蕴种印</color>的<color=#FFFFFFFF>可用次数</color>+1；\\n<img src='https://act-webstatic.mihoyo.com/hk4e/e20200928calculate/item_icon/67c7f719/b357f624efdec0c1cc0cc4f180e07db4.png' /><color=#80C0FFFF>水元素</color>：装备有此牌的纳西妲所生成的<color=#FFFFFFFF>摩耶之殿</color>初始<color=#FFFFFFFF>持续回合</color>+1。\\n（牌组中包含纳西妲，才能加入牌组）",
